{"id":8859736998087,"title":"Personalized Celtic Tree of Life Yggdrasil Quilt Sets, Bedroom Decor","handle":"personalized-celtic-tree-of-life-yggdrasil-quilt-sets-bedroom-decor","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the symbolism of resilience and interconnectedness with this beautiful Jeminise Quilt Set, featuring the stunning Tree of Life design. Perfect for adding a touch of meaningful decor to your home or as a thoughtful gift for loved ones, this quilt offers warmth and comfort throughout all seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAmazing Yggdrasil Quilt Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features the iconic Tree of Life, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit various bed sizes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProfessional Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with specially designed colorful themes on smooth material, suitable for both functional use and decorative appeal.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal gift for housewarmings, weddings, or special occasions, perfect for family members like moms, dads, sisters, brothers, grandmas, grandpas, wives, husbands, sons, and daughters.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Comes with 1 Quilt, with an optional Pillowcase.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Provides warmth for indoor and outdoor use, ideal for beds, sofas, reading, relaxing, camping, and picnics.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eProduct Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eQuilt Sets\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eMaterial\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolycotton\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFabric Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCotton, Polyester\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eColor\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eColorful Tree of Life\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eStyle\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eMinimalist\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eTheme\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTree of Life\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003ePattern\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTree of Life\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eIncluded Components\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCustomization\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 text input\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eAvailable Sizes\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eThrow(60x70 inches)| Twin(68x86 inches)| Full(80x90 inches)| Queen (90x90 inches)| King (91x102 inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCare Instructions\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eMachine Wash\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\u003c\/table\u003e","published_at":"2026-08-12T16:24:44-05:00","created_at":"2026-08-12T16:19:02-05:00","vendor":"Jeminise","type":"Quilt Sets","tags":["amazon-import","amazon-parent-b0dnq35hcn","Christmas Day","Dad Gift","Family Blanket","Mom Gift","Personalized Blank